From 80969d4226084f8942c27191705b3b2648a428f2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 10 Aug 2026 14:40:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Rebuild location pages to the new mockup, add three
 cities

Reworks the location page design to match the mockup: dark hero carrying the
H1, black trust bar, red storm band with icon cards, light services band with
white cards, dark CTA, warranty cards with gold badges, testimonial card,
recent-work gallery, and a credential badge strip.

Because the H1 now lives in the hero, a body class added from the pattern
markup hides the theme's red title band on these pages.

Adds Brentwood, Bridgeton, and Chesterfield. All three follow Ballwin's
services-before-storm order; Arnold remains the only page leading with storm
damage and the only one with the storm card column.

Layout notes: the parent theme's broad div width:100% rule and content-box
sizing meant padded components overflowed and flex columns collapsed, so the
new sections set box-sizing explicitly, div-qualify intrinsic widths, and
declare display:flex rather than relying on WordPress layout classes.
